OL,5,
OL,6,FThey are charged jointly with her
OL,7,Fex-husband Philip Young, 50, a former
OL,8,FConservative councillor, who has
OL,9,Fadmitted to drugging and raping her
OL,10,Fover 13 years.
OL,12,FAs the trial began, prosecutor Sarah
OL,13,FJones KC told the jury: "This case is
OL,14,Fabout whether it is ever reasonable to
OL,15,Fhave sex with an unknown woman without
OL,16,Fchecking with her first."
